&"1_1": {
"dialogue": "Combat training, eh? Don't worry, we'll be sure to pull our punches.",
"offset": Vector2(300, -1600),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_10": {
"dialogue": "Its a table with another note.",
"offset": Vector2(-1600, -740),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_11",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00195),
"speaker": "",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_100": {
"dialogue": "The latter are known as [i]internal reactions[/i] and you can have up to 2 per attack. I'll leave it up to you to figure out why and to explore any exceptions you might find.",
"offset": Vector2(3200, -1340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251.00049),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_101": {
"dialogue": "You're on the island of Forlorn.",
"offset": Vector2(1540, 3420),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_103",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(320.00244, 250.99854),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_102": {
"dialogue": "Well, yes... there's a few running around. ",
"offset": Vector2(620, 3620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_118",
"text": "That sounds dangerous"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_119",
"text": "Where do they come from?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 321.00244),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_103": {
"dialogue": "Just imagine a large rock floating in a void. ",
"offset": Vector2(1880, 3320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_105",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00244, 251.00012),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_104": {
"dialogue": "And feel free to ask me any questions you might have.",
"offset": Vector2(5600, 2740),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251.0011),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_105": {
"dialogue": "Right now, you're at the bottom most point, in a section called the Azure hotel.",
"offset": Vector2(2200, 3320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_106",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0017, 251.00012),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_106": {
"dialogue": "This area is unofficially considered the home of the [el]Blue[/el]-aligned and our enclaves.",
"offset": Vector2(2520, 3320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"6_4",
"text": "Blue-aligned?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_116",
"text": "Enclaves?"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_122",
"text": "What else is there?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00244, 355.9995),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_107": {
"dialogue": "...",
"offset": Vector2(3640, 3760),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"6_3",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 251.00049),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_108": {
"dialogue": "I feel sick...",
"offset": Vector2(4320, 3680),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_109",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00195, 251),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_109": {
"dialogue": "I'm sorry, it can take some time to come to terms with this inevitability.",
"offset": Vector2(4660, 3680),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_110",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0044, 300),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_11": {
"dialogue": "You're almost there! The exit is just up ahead.[br]
The next few puzzles use [i]Laser Bridges[/i]. These use highly concentrated Elemental energy to transmute any MagiClay objects dragged across them. [br]
Use the triangular [i]Reset[/i] block to return the puzzle to its starting configuration.",
"offset": Vector2(-1280, -740),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00195),
"speaker": "",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_110": {
"dialogue": "I don't mean to scare you. Just prepare you for what will come.",
"offset": Vector2(4980, 3680),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_111",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00146, 251),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_111": {
"dialogue": "Can we talk about something else, please?",
"offset": Vector2(5300, 3680),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_112",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 251),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_112": {
"dialogue": "Sure, what would you like to talk about?",
"offset": Vector2(5620, 3680),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"6_6",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_113": {
"dialogue": "Well, normally I'd suggest making your way to the surface",
"offset": Vector2(600, 4040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_123",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 250.99854),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_114": {
"dialogue": "But it pays to keep your wits around you.",
"offset": Vector2(1280, 3680),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_117",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00146, 251),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_115": {
"dialogue": "...",
"offset": Vector2(3260, 3380),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"6_3",
"text": "What did you mean by enclaves?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "Goodbye"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00244, 321.00146),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_116": {
"dialogue": "You're familiar with Alignment, right?",
"offset": Vector2(2920, 3580),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"6_3",
"text": "Yes"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"6_5",
"text": "No"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 321.0005),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_117": {
"dialogue": "That's partially why we emphasize the combat so early on to newcomers.",
"offset": Vector2(1600, 3680),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00146, 251),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_118": {
"dialogue": "Most of them aren't as big as the one in the hallway.",
"offset": Vector2(940, 3660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_114",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00085, 250.99902),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_119": {
"dialogue": "They kind of just... show up... for the most part.",
"offset": Vector2(1034.6877, 3983.882),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_120",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(340, 246.00098),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_12": {
"dialogue": "rawr xd ",
"offset": Vector2(260, -1940),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"4_6",
"text": "dlarv pls change this later"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 286),
"speaker": "",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_120": {
"dialogue": "I think the prevaling theory is that the majority are formed from coagulating elemental energy.",
"offset": Vector2(1400, 3980),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_121",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 250.99976),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_121": {
"dialogue": "But I wouldn't worry too much about them. Basic combat magic will be more than enough for you to reach the surface unscathed.",
"offset": Vector2(1760, 3940),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_122": {
"dialogue": "Well, above us is several miles of catacombs and caves.",
"offset": Vector2(2867.744, 4029.8928),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_131",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 246.00146),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_123": {
"dialogue": "There's an elevator in some caves north of here, but I've been told its out of order.",
"offset": Vector2(960, 4240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_124",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.0039),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_124": {
"dialogue": "In the meantime, there was a [el]Magenta[/el] cook starting up a kitchen nearby. I've been curious how that's been going.",
"offset": Vector2(1320, 4260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_125",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00146, 251.00171),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_125": {
"dialogue": "I believe they're setting up west of here.",
"offset": Vector2(1660, 4260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_126",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.00171),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_126": {
"dialogue": "And if you're feeling particularly athletic, you could pay my [el]Cyan[/el] friend a visit. ",
"offset": Vector2(1980, 4260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_127",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00171),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_127": {
"dialogue": "Their home is on an island south of the beach.",
"offset": Vector2(2320, 4240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_128",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251.0039),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_128": {
"dialogue": "Look for where the road falls into the sea, that's where the path starts.",
"offset": Vector2(2640, 4320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_129",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00073, 250.99878),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_129": {
"dialogue": "Please note, neither NPC mentioned have been added yet. ",
"offset": Vector2(3000, 4340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_130",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00122, 250.99854),
"speaker": "DLARV",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_13": {
"dialogue": "This is a note",
"offset": Vector2(-500, -2300),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 246),
"speaker": "",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_130": {
"dialogue": "The parkour challenge on the south beach is there if you want to play through it, but there is nothing at the end. Just to be respectful of your time lol.",
"offset": Vector2(3341.075, 4370.687),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246.00244),
"speaker": "DLARV",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_131": {
"dialogue": "Wait, I'm sorry. You mentioned to me earlier we would need to take an elevator to the surface?",
"offset": Vector2(3241.4255, 4056.9312),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_132",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00122, 246.00073),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_132": {
"dialogue": "You didn't mention this elevator is [i]miles[/i] long!",
"offset": Vector2(3560, 4060),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_133",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 250.99878),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_133": {
"dialogue": "Its a fast elevator.",
"offset": Vector2(3880, 4060),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_134",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 250.99878),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_134": {
"dialogue": "Once you're on the surface, your first destination should be the [i]Community Center[/i].",
"offset": Vector2(4200, 4060),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_135",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00244, 250.99878),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_135": {
"dialogue": "They should be able to handle your orientation from there. Its been awhile since I've reached the surface, so I don't want to give you any outdated information.",
"offset": Vector2(4520, 4060),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00195, 250.99878),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_136": {
"dialogue": "You took the last remaining packet.",
"offset": Vector2(-862.3714, -1610.787),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00003, 251),
"speaker": "",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_137": {
