"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_143": {
"dialogue": " t's 2v1.",
"offset": Vector2(4320, 2160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_60",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_144": {
"dialogue": "First, open your player menu by pressing 'P'",
"offset": Vector2(960, -900),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_145",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_145": {
"dialogue": "Then, switch to the \"Buttons and Beads\" tab.",
"offset": Vector2(1280, -900),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_146",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_146": {
"dialogue": "Then, select either an empty slot and choose an attack to equip...",
"offset": Vector2(1640, -940),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_147",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_147": {
"dialogue": "...or select an occupied slot to replace that attack with a new one.",
"offset": Vector2(1960, -940),
"options": {
